================================================================================
Third-party components
================================================================================

This repository contains only configuration and glue code (Lua, mpv.conf, and a
Node.js Native Messaging host). It does NOT vendor or redistribute the following
projects. They are downloaded dynamically at install time from their official
release pages, and each remains governed by its own upstream license:

  - mpv             https://mpv.io / https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv
  - uosc            https://github.com/tomasklaen/uosc
  - thumbfast       https://github.com/po5/thumbfast
  - mpv-sub-select  https://github.com/CogentRedTester/mpv-sub-select

Because these are fetched on demand, no third-party binaries or scripts are
shipped in this repository, and no third-party license text is bundled here.
Each project's own license (as published in its upstream repository) is the
authoritative and controlling license for that project.
